OL,3,GNEWSADuchy tenants may have to buy
OL,4,Afarms or leave as Prince William plans
OL,5,Asell-off
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlans by the Prince of Wales to sell
OL,8,Foff up to 20% of the Duchy of Cornwall
OL,9,Fcould see more tenant farmers across
OL,10,FEngland asked to buy their farms or
OL,11,Fmove out.
OL,13,FUp to 40 farm holdings across Devon,
OL,14,FCornwall, Herefordshire and the
OL,15,FMidlands could be affected by the sale,
OL,16,Faccording to the Tenant Farmers
OL,17,FAssociation (TFA).
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
