OL,3,GNEWSADuchy tenants may have to buy
OL,4,Afarms or leave as Prince William plans
OL,5,Asell-off
OL,6,
OL,7,FLocals say talks over the future of
OL,8,Fnine farms on the Bradninch estate in
OL,9,FDevon have already caused "distress"
OL,10,Ffor some tenants who fear they cannot
OL,11,Fafford to buy.
OL,13,FA spokeswoman said the Duchy could not
OL,14,Fconfirm the total number of tenants
OL,15,Faffected by the ten-year sale plan but
OL,16,Ftold the BBC the estate was "supporting
OL,17,Fthem through the process with care and
OL,18,Frespect".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
